# Conformance probe pack for `hex` in a sequential layout (spec 0.22). Public.
# No kinds. Most significant bit first.
#
#   12 bits       label  three hex digits; the message is padded to 16 bits
format     conformance-long-hex-seq
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
field   probe.label  12  hex
